-- Migration: Remove listings that are not coffee shops
-- Created: 2026-10-30
--
-- The directory was seeded from place searches that also returned
-- restaurants, bars, breweries, hotels, markets, gas stations and fast-food
-- chains that happen to serve coffee (reported: Woods Hill Table, a
-- restaurant/bar at 24 Commonwealth Ave, Concord, MA). This removes 1,794 of
-- them, each matched on id AND name AND address so it can never remove a
-- different shop. Runs after 20261030_01, so each id is the copy it kept.
--
-- The list was generated by scripts/audit-listings.js --sql from the names
-- alone (the table has no place type). It skips any name with a coffee word
-- and ambiguous ones (bakeries, donut/bagel shops, bookstores, museums,
-- "Something's Brewing"). Each row's comment says why it was flagged.
--
-- coffee_shops_fts is not touched: see 20261030_01.
--
-- Forward-only, like the 20261017 migrations: no down section, so
-- `migrate.js down` refuses rather than resurrecting removed listings.

